WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.800
I think some of the best conversations that we've had have been the conversations that break down reality from false reality.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:15.240
In entertainment, you know, you get hit with a false reality that this is your life and this is what it's going to be forever.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:20.480
Oh my God, you're famous and you make money forever.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.720
That's not the case.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:27.200
And if you're not a person that can understand that, you get caught up in the matrix.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:38.240
And when that goes away, you don't know what life is because you fell into the perception that life is this fake fictional presentation.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.200
And it's not. Life changes.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.320
There's ups and downs.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.160
Moments are great and then they're bad.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:45.800
And entertainment, that's what it is.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:50.160
So just because we're hot today does not mean we'll be hot tomorrow.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:55.240
But the smart people that are hot today prepare for the times when they may not be hot.

